{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350930/extras/ghost-117.gif?t=1747650175\" />\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350930/extras/crategoal-117.gif?t=1747650175\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350930/extras/trampoline-117.gif?t=1747650175\" />\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350930/extras/key-117.gif?t=1747650175\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Trifolium</strong> is an open-world 3D puzzle game, where you discover the hidden rules of a mysterious land. You'll stumble upon surprises, reveal secrets, and learn how to navigate around your own neck. Each crossing shapes your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350930/extras/keys-612.gif?t=1747650175\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo contains more than 25\u00a0<strong>hand-crafted</strong> puzzles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No filler</strong> content. Each puzzle presents a new idea or twist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All puzzles are integrated into a single, <strong>open world</strong>, allowing you to choose your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An interactive <strong>hint system</strong> lets you enter a simplified version of a puzzle that guides you towards the key idea.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No timers</strong>\u00a0or reflex-based challenges. Solve puzzles at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlimited <strong>undos</strong>, restarts, and the ability to quickly undo to a specific point.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350930/extras/pillar.gif?t=1747650175\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3350930?t=1747650175","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3350930?t=1747650175","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350930/5cae9eeda302ad36fb84eb5490951e459502fe19/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747650175","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350930/5cae9eeda302ad36fb84eb5490951e459502fe19/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747650175","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350930/extras/ghost-117.gif?t=1747650175\" />\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350930/extras/crategoal-117.gif?t=1747650175\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350930/extras/trampoline-117.gif?t=1747650175\" />\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350930/extras/key-117.gif?t=1747650175\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Trifolium</strong> is an open-world 3D puzzle game, where you discover the hidden rules of a mysterious land. You'll stumble upon surprises, reveal secrets, and learn how to navigate around your own neck. Each crossing shapes your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350930/extras/keys-612.gif?t=1747650175\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p c